{"text": "His eyes asked her the question, Which. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There was not a moment to lose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The princess raised her right hand a little, and no one saw it except the young man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Without a pause, he walked across the arena and opened the door on the right. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Now the point of the story is this, did the tiger come out of that door, or did the lady. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The more we think about it, the harder it is to answer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Night after night, the princess had imagined him torn by the tiger. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But more often she had imagined him opening the other door and marrying the lady she hated. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She had seen his happy face and heard the wedding bells in her mind, and she had cried in pain. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Would it not be better for him to die at once and wait for her in a better world. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She had thought about it for days and nights, and she had made her decision. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I leave the question to you, the reader, which came out of the opened door, the lady, or the tiger.", "alignment": {"characters": ["H", "i", "s", " ", "e", "y", "e", "s", " ", "a", "s", "k", "e", "d", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "q", "u", "e", "s", "t", "i", "o", "n", ",", " ", "W", "h", "i", "c", "h", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "a", " ", "m", "o", "m", "e", "n", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "l", "o", "s", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "p", "r", "i", "n", "c", "e", "s", "s", " ", "r", "a", "i", "s", "e", "d", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "r", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "h", "a", "n", "d", " ", "a", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", 